  "colorLightRule": "designed, not derived: same roles and hues as the dark set. Grounds: bg.window mid-light graphite, surface.panel lighter (cards), surface.raised and knob.cap white, surface.inset one step darker than the panel (wells recess). Inks: text roles >= 4.5:1 on panel and inset; marks >= 3:1 on panel; mod is a mark colour only (rings, traces, dots, amount bars), its traces inside display wells 2.5 px; ink on a filled role (solo, arm, cycle, default button) is the light ground. Accents (signal, mod, loop, meter.ok, meter.hot) >= CIEDE76 20 apart for normal, protan, deutan and tritan vision. Clip and track colours come from palette, not re-derived; aliases follow their token",
